            //  Conversions

                  Long ( Double )  -->  Literal  (  String  )
                  Long ( Double )  -->  Symbol  (  String  )
                  Long ( Double )  -->  Operator Type  (  Integer  )
                  Long ( Double )  -->  Priority  (  Long  )

